# Raw AppFolio pulls: 75MB, re-fetched by build.py --refresh on every run.
# geocode.json is the exception - it is the expensive-to-rebuild part and is
# committed so a normal refresh geocodes nothing.
# coord_overrides.json holds the hand-curated coordinates (Aston Square,
# Valencia Isle - new builds no geocoder knows). If it is not committed, the
# CI rebuild silently drops those pins.
cache/*.json
!cache/geocode.json
!cache/coord_overrides.json
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
.env
